OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor in court denies five
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham councillor will face trial
OL,7,Fnext year after denying assaults on
OL,8,Ffive people, including three police
OL,9,Fofficers.
OL,11,FSiobhan Harper-Nunes, 66, who was
OL,12,Felected as a Green Party councillor for
OL,13,FLadywood in the city council's
OL,14,Felections in May, denied the offences
OL,15,Fat Birmingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
