OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor in court denies five
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarper-Nunes, of Monument Road,
OL,7,FBirmingham, was charged in connection
OL,8,Fwith an incident that led officers to
OL,9,Fbe called to the junction of Monument
OL,10,FRoad and Hagley Road in Edgbaston, on 6
OL,11,FAugust.
OL,13,FDistrict Judge Michelle Smith told the
OL,14,Fdefendant that she would face a trial
OL,15,Flasting a day and a half on 19 and 20
OL,16,FJuly 2027. The councillor was allowed
OL,17,Fto remain on unconditional bail.
